2 CONT Jeremy Richard Lichtman (Nov 7, 2025):
2 CONT
2 CONT The following is based on a) Artscroll "The Rishonim" and b) Wikipedia.
2 CONT Very little is known biographically of Shmuel ben Sincha, compared to his father and his son.
2 CONT 1. His mother is unknown. The profile currently attached seems broken.
2 CONT 2. His wife was Miriam, the grand-daughter of Rashi (not Chana de Vitry, grand-daughter of Rashi). Miriam was indeed the daughter of R Meir ben Shmuel and Yocheved bat Rashi).
2 CONT 3. There is only record of a single child - the RI. I think the Rachel Troyes link is an old attempt to link up the Troyes fmaily to Rashi. There's been some discussion of this online recently, but I can't recall the source.
2 CONT 4. His birth and death dates are conjecture. I haven't found a source.
