1 NAME Meir HaRofeh /ibn Aldabi/ Author of Shevilei Emunah
2 GIVN Meir HaRofeh
2 NSFX Author of Shevilei Emunah
2 _MARNM ibn Aldabi
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1310
2 ADDR
