2 CONC & Chief Rabbi of Brest-Litovsk (Brisk), Brest-Litovsk, Poland, First Rabbi of Brisk (Brest Litovak), First Rabbi of Brest-Litovak (Brisk), Chief Rabbi, Heilbron, Landau Death:	Sep 16 1521   Brest-Litovsk, Belarus Burial:	1470   Br
2 CONC est, Brest Province, Belarus
