1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From David Gans, Zemach David:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1576/77   Rabbi Natan of Grodno, son of my uncle, Shimshon Spira z"l......... Natan died in 5337, and he left two sons who were great in Torah: r' Isaac who was Rosh Y. in Kabla (?) and r' Issachar, who was Rosh Y. in Pinsk. And a
2 CONC t this time he (Issachar) is Rosh Y. & AB"D in Worms [Worms Mem. p.5 and see his daughter Epidat wrm-3021 – her name is really Gelle, per Gruene Buch]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT >>''If anyone has information or sources regarding this profile, please send a message to the mangers, or add a note in this section. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [In response to above, see: Jacobi: p. 188, 16.4, V4, which asserts him to be https://www.geni.com/people/Shimshon-Spira/6000000190275486832, son of: https://www.geni.com/people/David-Spira/6000000028569115062; this appears to be 
2 CONC an unfounded conjecture. Otser HaRabanim shows him as # 20097 son of Nathan Nota # 16372 (04 January 2024) ]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''PLEASE NOTE:'''  Further investigation is required to verify if Shimon is Jehiel Michal's father, as  some important sources disputing his being the father of Jehiel Michal have been brought to light,  and instead ascertain tha
2 CONC t  Yosef Yerushalmi Spira as Gaon Jehiel Michal's father.
2 CONT
2 CONT See also Fig. 7 in [http://www.surnamedna.com/?articles=y-dna-of-the-savran-bendery-chassidic-dynasty#ref23 Y-DNA Genetic Signature of the Savran-Bendery Chassidic Dynasty]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Kalman Yerushalmi Spira (bef 1504 - ) > father of Yosef Yerushalmi Spira ( bef 1522 - ) > father of Yechiel below *ref. document and Lawrence Weinberg - 
2 CONT [http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~prohel/names/loew/spira/spira_3.html#ye  ''Source]
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Rabbi Yechiel Michel SPIRA (born about 1530, rabbi in Posen).  Shimshon as father conflicts with information from Lawrence WEINBERG devoutbokononist@gmail.com who has two sources claiming Yechiel Michel SPIRA's father was Yosef
2 CONC  Yerushalmi SPIRA.  -[http://www.loebtree.com/spiras.html ''Source]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. [http://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000018808609007#  '''Shapira Family Tree Chart] 
2 CONT
