2 CONT
2 CONT '''DOCUMENTS
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~prohel/pictures/Loew/Spira/Yoseph_Spira.pdf  '''Hebrew Document]  showing '''Yosef''' as the  father of '''Yechiel''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://newsgroups.derkeiler.com/Archive/Soc/soc.genealogy.medieval/2007-06/msg00310.html  '''Luria Family Tree]  From Rosenstein, Rottenberg, Encyclopeadia Judaica & Jewish Encyclopedia.
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.jewishencyclopedia.com/view.jsp?artid=1017&letter=S  '''Spira Family]  Jewish Encyclopedia, "Die Grabschriften des alten Judenfriedhof in Wien" - Dr. Bernhard Wachstein, Band I pg. 404
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~prohel/names/loew/spira/spira_3.html#ye '''Rohel Spira Tree]  According to Lawrence Weinberg Yechiel Michel Spira's father should be Yosef Yerushalmi Spira (born bef 1522 - ) son of Kalma
2 CONC n Yerushalmi Spira (born bef 1504 - ). 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT *[http://www.davidicdynasty.org/shapiro_art.php  '''Shapira Family Tree]  
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Nathan Nata SPIRA was rabbi in Posen.  His son was '''Rabbi Shimshon SPIRA'''. Rabbi Shimshon SPIRA was also rabbi in Posen.  His children:
2 CONT >>>	•	(6a) Rabbi Nathan Nata SPIRA (died in 1577), rabbi in Grodno, author of Mevo Shearim and Imrei Shefer, grandfather of R. Nathan Nata SPIRA (1585 - 1633, author of Megaleh Amukot) 
2 CONT
