2 CONT R. Elijahu  “Baal Schem“ married Blumelin, the daughter of R. Zangwill
2 CONT
2 CONT of Worms.  From 1600 to 1612 Elijahu was Rabbi of Fulda and then he became Rabbi of 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hanau.  In 1629 he moved to Worms, where Blumelin died on 6 November 1630, the 
2 CONT
2 CONT mother of his only son Joseph (Josel), husband of Kela, who was born at Hanau.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT né entre 1551 et 1564 à Francfort
2 CONT
2 CONT rabbin successivement à Fulda, Hanau, Friedberg et Worms, il fut l'élève d'Akiba FRANKFURTER, de Jacob GÜNZBURG de Friedberg, puis de Juda Loew, dit le Maharal de Prague
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------- On 03/12/2015 updated date of death as described in the Register Hekdesh book of Worms (כ"א בתמוז השצ"ו), I would be happy to cooperate on Loantz and more Ariel Samuel Beit Shemesh Israel
2 CONT
2 CONT R. Elijahu “Baal Schem“ married Blumelin, the daughter of R. Zangwill of Worms. From 1600 to 1612 Elijahu was Rabbi of Fulda and then he became Rabbi of
2 CONT
2 CONT Hanau. In 1629 he moved to Worms, where Blumelin died on 6 November 1630, the
2 CONT
2 CONT mother of his only son Joseph (Josel), husband of Kela, who was born at Hanau.
2 CONT
