1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Source: Elef Margaliot Edited by Rabbi Meir Wunder, Page 493, Entry 711. Rabbi Wunder states that Moses Aharon Katz is the grandfather of Aharon Menachem Ha-Cohen, but that the name of Aharon Menachem's father (e.g
2 CONC . the son of Moses Aharon Katz) is not known. Rabbi Moses Aharon Katz was a Parnas and leader in Krackow and died in 1615. He had three known sons.
