1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: surname name is not Heller.  That is mistake in Rosenstein.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Hanale 
2 CONT
2 CONT [daughter of R' Moses Katzenellenbogen, A.B.D. of Chelm, died after 1643 married Sarah, daughter of R' Benjamin Benas of Posen]
2 CONT
2 CONT married in 1643 to R' Nathan HaLevi, son of R. Zeev Wolf HaLevi Segal (married Nissel, daughter of R' YomTov Limpman HaLevi Heller, author of Tosfos Yomtov, died in Cracow in 1654)."
2 CONT
2 CONT Her children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT # R' Moses HaLevi Heller
2 CONT # Nissel, named after her paternal grandmother, born about 1670, wife of R' Samuel Schick.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source:''' page 40, Third Edition of The Unbroken Chain (2017) by Neil Rosenstein. Avotaynu
2 CONT
2 CONT Rosenstein cites
2 CONT * Schick, R' Solomon Zvi, Mi Moshe Ad Moshe, Kahn and Fried Publishers (Munkacs 1903), page 20 for Moses and his sister Nissel
2 CONT --------------------
