1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.jewishgen.org/yizkor/minsk/min1_086.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ... a certain portion of the city wished to appoint Rabbi Aryeh Leib as the replacement for his father Rabbi Asher as district rabbi, and his brother '''Rabbi Yitzchak Avraham''' as the rabbi of the city. The supporters of Rabbi M
2 CONC oshe Heilprin finally prevailed, and he was appointed as rabbi of the city of Minsk in the year 5504 (1744).
2 CONT
2 CONT The position of district rabbi remained vacant for several years. In the year 5509 (1749) '''Rabbi Yitzchak Avraham''' was appointed as district rabbi in place of his father. However, he quickly found that the burden was too great
2 CONC  and took most of his time. He gave up his position in 5516 (1756). He then dedicated himself to Torah and teaching in Minsk, and died in the year 5536 (1776).
2 CONT --------------------
