1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT From the book "renewal" by the late David Aviram (Raw food Publishers, 1993), page 46:
2 CONT
2 CONT "The second son of Rabbi David Halevi is a sixteenth Rabbi Shlomo Segal. It seems that the name was given to him after his grandfather, Rabbi Shlomo Zalman Levy. Rabbi Shlomo Halevi was killed along with his older brother, Rabbi M
2 CONC ordechai, when pogroms against the Jews of Lviv, Saturday 03/05/1664. this is not always tell of her Black Friday. "... masses of Christians around the city of Lviv gathered religious procession Jews rioted in the suburbs. Jewish 
2 CONC guard standing next to a synagogue, succeeded in driving the mob gangs and farmers attackers. When they came to the students and the urban militia to restore order, also joined the mob. Jews were forced to pull back, and then bega
2 CONC n a terrible massacre. The mob broke into Jewish homes, murder and looting. Torah scrolls were torn apart in the synagogue, all the holy vessels shattered and Cantor was killed at the Ark. "One hundred dead - including two sons of
2 CONC  Rabbi David Halevi - and about two hundred wounded, the death toll was the same Saturday."
