1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  (Source: David Kaufmann, Zur Geschichte der Familie Dreyfuss, p 425.)
2 CONT
2 CONT The MAHARA"M, Rabbi in Stuehlingen; Studied with R. Meir (the MAHARA'M) of Lublin who named him Mar Y'noka; was a man of means who funded the building of a synagogue in Stuehlingen, employing the usual lime, but coloring it with r
2 CONC ed wine instead of water. There is also controversy regarding his death date as well as the date of his coming to Stuehlingen which had been reported in the literature as 1672.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Peter Stein's analysis makes this impossible, estimating his death in 1647 and arrival in Stuehlingen much earlier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source : --> http://www.jewishgen.org/rabbinic/journal/weil_chart2.htm
