1 NAME Ascher Lemle /Weil/
2 GIVN Ascher Lemle
2 SURN Weil
2 _MARNM Weil
2 NICK Asher
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1610
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ascher Lemle Weil (Source: Werner Frank assumption), born Abt. 1610.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	Notes for Ascher Lemle Weil:
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Stein in Maajan, Heft 59. Asher Lemle is mentioned in Stuehlingen. If his son was born around 1640, then he might well have been born in the period 1610. This would place him in the approximate generation of Jeckoff a
2 CONC nd Maharam Weil, assumed brothers of Rabbi Samuel Uri Schraga Weil. Since we have no better information at this time, but do have strong belief that Asher Lemle is a Weil descendant, we connect him as a son of R. S. U. S. Weil.
