1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sources:  Toldot Yehudi Brody; Jewish Virtual Library;  Sefer Mazkeret li-gedole Ostraha
2 CONT
2 CONT  In Toldot Yehudi Brody, Abraham Kahana's father is identified as Shalom Shachna Kahana. In the Jewish Encylcopedia (1906) Abraham Kahana's father is identified as Samuel Kahana. In Sefer Mazkeret li-gedole Ostraha, Menachem Mende
2 CONC l Biber (the author)states that there are in fact two alternative genealogies for Abraham Kahana and that it is not clear if Abraham Kahana's father is Shalom Shachna Kahana or Samuel Kahana
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Elf Margaliot By Rabbi Meir Wunder, Page 491 - Item # 709 "Ha Rav Shalom Shachna Katz From Cracow.  This is a lengthy article about Shalom Shachna Kahana and his genealogy and includes his date of death.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Source: Meorei Galicia (Encyclopedia of Galacian Sages) By Rabbi Meir Wunder: Volume 3, Page 321.
2 CONT
2 CONT The information regarding Shalom Shachna Kahana is found under the heading for his great-grandson Abraham Aryeh Lieb Kahana (1725 - 1788).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Source: The Unbroken Chain, Neil Rosenstein, P. 497 Shalom Shachna Kahana is called RaSHaCH
