2 CONC p. HIS FIRST WIFE WAS BORN IN 1646 HILDESHEIM, GERMANY AND WAS THE MOTHER OF R' YEHUDA (JUDAH) LANDAU. SHE WAS THE GRANDMOTHER OF THE NODA B'YEHUDA.מוזכר בפנקס  קהילת אפטא בשנים  1686-1718
2 CONT --------------------
