2 CONC 1 2  Name: Rabbi Hirsch WITELES  Name: Hirsch WITUSH  Birth: 1643 in Opatów, Swietokrzyskie, Poland  Death: 1714  Event: Event Delegate to the Council of the Four Lands  Occupation: Vorsteher der Vierländer
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ezekiel (Rabbi) LANDAU b: BET 1615 AND 1618 in Kraków, Poland  Mother: Witush bat Isaac CHARIF b: ABT 1618 in Opatów, Swietokrzyskie, Poland
