2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT " 	
2 CONT
2 CONT Managers of Mrs. Katz, [Lasker], of Nemirov,
2 CONT
2 CONT I am studying the family of a friend who is descended from the mochiach and from what I read the Yechiel Michel's brother published his works shortly after his death and said in the preface that there was only one grandson who die
2 CONC d in Arabia. I know there are other books that trace their lineage to them, but I don't think any of them are as close to Yechiel Michel Nemirov than his brother
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,
2 CONT
2 CONT Kleinman"
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
