2 CONT Dear Randy, Unfortunately, I cannot now do any further genealogical research. Hypothesis:  Ramshaq = R. Shimon Katzaw seems interesting, but, now, can neither aprove or disaprove this.  In this moment, to the Katzaw family I have 
2 CONC only some data at the hand:  Anonymous daughter of r. David Gans maried Jokev Kosteletz (from Kostelec nad Labem), their daughter Nechama bat Jokev Kosteletz maried Mordechai ben Shimon/Simmel Katzaw. Their sons are: 1) David ben 
2 CONC Mordechai (°° Sercha bat Mordechai Altschul) , 2 Leib ben Mordechai, 3) Shimon/Simmeln ben Mordechai, 4) ?)_ Selig ben Mordechai Katzaw (°° Sarl bat Sholem Natan Chazan) i      Next week, I will have to check genealogical in my mu
2 CONC seum computer. Kol tuv, Alexandr
