2 CONT
2 CONT Plot  2012; Year 5451, Tammuz, Leader and superior, The honorable Michel, son of the chief, our teacher David, Dayyan of blessed memory, from Vienna.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Die Familien Prags. Nach den Epitaphien des alten jüdischen Friedhofs in Prag, Authors: Simon Hock; David Kaufmann Pressburg, 1892. Page 110.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~prohel/names/loew/loewdes.html#spira
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: '''Michael''' remained in Vienna and his memory was perpetuated by his gift of several valuable curtains to the Old-New School of Prague.
2 CONT
2 CONT Perel Wiener (with her husband Michel and his father David Chayim Wiener), her brothers chaim and Todros,  and their mother Yehudit wife of R' Elezer Todros,  are listed in "Anaf Etz Avoth" ''(H) by Shmuel Sanvil Kahana, Krakow 19
2 CONC 03, page 26 (XXVI) under item 211 (resh, yod, alef)'' as descendents of Gaon '''Chayim m'Worms''' (nephew of Maharal of Prague) - ''source dr. Yehuda Klausner''
2 CONT
2 CONT Michal Wiener is mentioned in Prof. David Kaufmann's "Die letzte Vertreibung der Juden aus Wien und Niederösterreich" on page 189, see documents. His grave inscription is given in Hock p. 110.
2 CONT
2 CONT any relation to ?? descendant of [http://www.geni.com/people/Michael-Wiener/6000000005061495762 '''Michael Wiener'''], the chairman of the Chewra Kadischa in Prague and of Michael Bachrach, the chief Rabbi of Prague (d. 1795) - re
2 CONC f. "Die Familie Wolf" - by Ernst Wolf 1924 -   http://www.fpe.ch/stammbaum/ see no. 186a ??
2 CONT
