2 CONT Rabbi Naftali Herz (Cerf) BRANDEIS SEGAL (b. around 1680, d. Uckange/Lothringen) went to Uckange near Metz where he married Hendele FRIEDBERG (Uckange)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Edel BRANDEIS (b. Uckange) married (1730 Metz) Goudchaux Joseph BONN son of the Landesrabbiner 
2 CONT * Soltas BRANDEIS (b. Uckange) married Isaac WORMS 
2 CONT * Jacob BRANDEIS (b. Uckange) married (1732 Metz) Eve GUELMINGUEN. 
2 CONT * Moise BRANDEIS (b. Uckange) married Sara SALOMON.
2 CONT
