1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Judah_Leib_ben_Isaac '''Judah Leib ben Isaac''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://kehilalinks.jewishgen.org/Krakow/kra_rabbis.htm ''Judah Leib ben Isaac''']
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Judah Leib ben Isaac of Szydłów''' (Hebrew: יהודה לייב בן יצחק משדלוב; d. 1730) was an 18th-century Polish rabbi and Talmudist. Born to an old and distinguished rabbinic family, his father Yitzchak ben Shmuel Zak was the Chief 
2 CONC Rabbi of Przemyśl and later Krakow. His mother was the daughter of Joshua Höschel ben Joseph (the Meginei Shlomo). In his early years, Judah Leib officiated as rabbi in Szydłów, Statchov, Rakow, and later serving as representative
2 CONC  of Kraków in the Council of Four Lands (Vaad Arba Artzot). In 1713 he succeeded his father as the Av Beis Din and Rosh Yeshiva at Kraków, where he remained till his death in 1731.  His children:  1. Rabbi David Shmuel, the Av Bei
2 CONC t Din of Cracow, grandfather of https://www.geni.com/people/Rebbe-Shmuel-of-Karov/6000000006828432211. 2. Rabbi Yosef, the Av Beit Din of Pintchov father of https://www.geni.com/people/R-Menachem-Mendel-of-Rymanov/6000000009148253
2 CONC 986 3. Rabbi Yitzchak, the Av Beit Din of Tarnow, grandfather of https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Shmelke-Licht-ABD-Bumsla/6000000077585091883. 4. Rabbi Yehoshua, the Av Beit Din of Shidlov, ggfather of https://www.geni.com/peopl
2 CONC e/Gaon-Rav-Shlomo-Kluger-Maharshak-Maggid-of-Brody/6000000004693479361
2 CONT
2 CONT            ********************************
