2 CONT R' Aaron Moses Ezekiel Lwow (Lemberger), 1st Rabbi of Treves and then A.B.D. of Westhofen MP
2 CONT Gender: Male Birth: circa 1660  L'viv, L'vivs'ka oblast, Ukraine Death: November 26, 1712 (48-56)  Westhoffen, Alsace, France Immediate Family: Son of Moses of Lemberg Lwow Lemberger and Keile Levov, Lwow  Husband of unknown 1st w
2 CONC ife of R' Aaron Moses Ezekiel Lwow and Bella Rebekka Lwow Lemberger, Lichtenstadt  Father of R' Joshua Heschel Lwow, A.B.D. Treves and Schwabach; Rose Reislé Goudchaux; R' Joseph Aron Lwow, A.B.D. of Trebitsch; R' Moyses, Moses Le
