2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Yehoshua is NOT identified as a son of Shalom Shachna (or a brother of Abraham Kahana (d. 1741) in the list of the children of Shalom Shachna Kahana in Meorei Galicia (Encyclopedia of Galacian Sages) By Rabbi Meir Wunder: Volu
2 CONC me 3, Page 321.   
2 CONT
2 CONT       *****************************
2 CONT
2 CONT Is possibly the Joshua son of Sholem Shachna Kantorovitsh who was Krakow representative to the Council of Four Lands in 1730; his sister Esther married Zacharia Mendel Kantorovitsh who was Parnas of the Council in 1700 and also a 
