2 CONT R' YEHUDA (JUDAH) LANDAU (B.1672 HILDESHEIM- D.1737, on the 13th day of Kislev, in APTOW) - CHAYA - (D.1740). THEY WERE THE PARENTS OF THE NODA B'YEHUDA. CHAYA WAS THE DAUGHTER OF ELEAZAR. Yehuda was the son of Zvi Hirsh Vitesh Wi
2 CONC teles (Charif) Landau.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Yehuda Landa, in addition to being considerably wealthy, was a learned man and an outstanding communal worker. Rabbi Judah was, in fact, the life-long president of the Opatow community and deputy of the "Council of the Four 
2 CONC Lands" (ארבע ארצות).
2 CONT
2 CONT (m.Katzenellenbogen-Heschel)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=lorenfamily&id=I67096
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Judah (Yehuda) LANDAU Sex: M Birth: 1672 in Hildesheim Occupation: Rabbi Death: 06 DEC 1737 in Opatów, Swietokrzyskie, Poland Name: Juda LANDAU 1 Name: Judah LANDAU Name: Yehuda LANDAU Name: Yehuda (Rabbi) LANDAU Occupation:
2 CONC  Vorsteher in Opatów, Swietokrzyskie, Poland 1
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>אביו של ה"נודע ביהודה", רבי יהודה בן צבי הירש סג”ל לנדאו, היה יהודי אמיד ויחד עם זאת תלמיד חכם שפעל רבות למען הקהילה של עיירת מולדתו. הוא שימש ראש הקהל במקומו כל ימי חייו והיה חבר ב”ועד ארבע הארצות”. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-------
2 CONC -------------</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>R' YEHUDA (JUDAH) LANDAU (B.1672 HILDESHEIM- D.1737, on the 13th day of Kislev, in APTOW) - CHAYA - (D.1740). THEY WERE THE PARENTS OF THE NODA B'YEHUDA. CHAYA WAS THE DAUGHTER OFELEAZAR. Yehuda wa
2 CONC s the son of Zvi Hirsh Vitesh Witeles (Charif) Landau. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>--------------------</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>נמנה על פרנסי העיר אפטא וחבר ב"ועד ארבע הארצות". נזכר בפנקסי קהילת אפטא בין השנים 1709-1739 </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rab
2 CONC bi Yehuda Landa, in addition to being considerably wealthy, was a learned man and an outstanding communal worker. Rabbi Judah was, in fact, the life-long president of the Opatow community and deputy of the "Council of the Four Lan
2 CONC ds" (ארבע ארצות).</p><p>&nbsp;</p>(m.Katzenellenbogen-Heschel)
