2 CONT Rabbi in Eibenschitz - http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~prohel/names/eybeschutz/eybeschutz.html#eibe ''(sorry, this page link no longer works & can Not be fixed due to Ancestry no longer allowing Uploads - 2024)''  - thus 
2 CONC page Uploaded to Media > Documents: https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000204562335845
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Natan Natte Eybeshuetz Spira Shapiro (son of Asher Yitzhak Zelig Eybeschuetz Spira Shapiro and Daughter Yeshayahu Ashkenazi) was born 1660, and died 07 11 1707 in Moravia. He married Scheindel Tsontz Zinz, daughter of Arieh Leib T
2 CONC sontz Zinz and Rachel Teomim Frankel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Natan Natte Eybeshuetz Spira Shapiro and Scheindel Tsontz Zinz are:  +Arieh Yehuda Leib Eybeschuetz. +Jonatan Eybeshuetz, b. 1690, Krakov Poland, d. 18 09 1764, Hamburg Germany. +Aharon Eybeshuetz Fird, b. 1700, Krakov
2 CONC  Poland http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/r/u/b/Leon-Rubinstein/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1168.html
