2 NICK Uri Liepaman
1 NAME "HaGaon HaGadol" Rabbi Uri Lipman Fraenkel
1 SEX M
1 OCCU unknown
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Austria
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Rabbi, Darshan
2 ADDR
