2 NICK Feigale
1 SEX F
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1737
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Inscription from Gravestone in Ancient Cemetery of Prague: 
2 CONT
2 CONT שנת 1737 — פיגלה בת מוהר״ר חיים בן הגאון מו״ה נפתלי כ״ץ (מלובלין), נכד הגאון מוהר״ר ליב, רבה של פראג זצ״ל, מגזע רש״י והמהרש״ל, אשת מוהר״ר פייבל זצ״ל מבומסלא, דיין בית הדין הגדול בפראג.
2 CONT (Source: Epitaphs from the Ancient Jewish Cemetery of Prague, Edited by Otto Muneles, p. 289-90)
2 CONT
2 CONT Rough translation: Year 1737-- Feigla, daughter of 'Mahar"r' Chaim ben HaGaon Naftali Katz (from Lublin) [refers https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Naftali-Hirsch-Katz-ABD-Lublin-Peirot-Genosar/6000000000071156161], grandson of the
2 CONC  HaGaon 'Mahar"r' Leyb [https://www.geni.com/people/Yehuda-ben-Betzalel-Loew-MaHaRaL-of-Prague/6000000002236005169], rabbi of Prague zt'l, from the stem of Rashi and the Maharsh'l [refers to https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%94%D7%9
2 CONC E%D7%94%D7%A8%D7%A9-%D7%9C/6000000002288008174], wife of 'Mahar"r' Faivel zt'l of Bumsla, judge of  the Great Court in Prague.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 178	Fegele (Vogel) bt Chaim bn haGaon Loeb* (sic!!) AB”D Prag zTs”l m’gizeh Rashi v’ Maharashal, e’ Feivel zTs”l m’Bumsla dajan peh Prag 1737  (Footnote: Sister of haGaon Naftali k”Ts AB”D Glogau, grandson of Naftali k”Ts AB”D Lub
2 CONC lin who is mentioned by Pereles. R’ Chaim, his father, was son-in-law of Jechiel Lurie bn Shlemo Rofe m’Lublin) “Loeb*” is just a misprint. Both Notes and Footnote confirm Naftali.
2 CONT
2 CONT 35	eshet Feivel k”Ts  No Year  [Notes: Feigle (Vogel) e’ Feivel k”Ts z”l m’Bumsla dajan peh Prag bt Chaim bn haGaon Naftali k”Ts, neched haGaon Loeb AB”D peh Prag z”l 1736/37] Moved into chronological order.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
