1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://en.hebron.org.il/history/520 '''Lipin, Dov''']; 26: Born in Vitebsk, Russia in 1903. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After high school, he studied at several yeshivas, including Slobodka - Knesset Yisrael in Lithuania. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He came to Hebron in 1926 and was part of the fourth class at Slobodka - Knesset Yisrael’s branch there. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was murdered in Slonim’s house and was among those who attempted to keep the door closed. He managed to say “Run and hide yourselves!” before he was axed down next to the door.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------
