1 NAME Menachem Nahum /Katzenellenpogen/ A.B.D. Kedainiai
2 GIVN Menachem Nahum
2 SURN Katzenellenpogen
2 NSFX A.B.D. Kedainiai
2 _MARNM Katzenellenpogen
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1790
1 TITL R'
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} G10.1 R. Menachem Nachum Katzenellenpogen, succeeded his father as ABD Kedainiai.  His signatures in the Community Records are dated from 1770-1778.  He wrote an approbation together with his father and uncle dated
2 CONC  27 Nisan, 1773, to Tiferet Yisrael, published in Frankfurt-on-Main in 1774.....
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (3rd edition) Volume 3, Chapter 8, page 422.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT According to [https://keidaner.com/181rabbis-of-keidan/] he died in Kedainiai in 1790.
