1 NOTE {geni:about_me} G10.10  '''Meshullam Zalman Katzenellenpogen''', born about 1750,  son of G9.1 Abraham Katzenellenpogen, ABD Slutsk and then Brest-Litovsk, born about 1720/1730 and died in 1804.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (3rd edition) Volume 3, pages 357 and 418.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Please note that the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) The above source does not indicate who his wife or children were
2 CONT 2) He had an uncle with the same name, so please don't confuse them!
