2 CONC ather being AB”D and R”M there in Bumsla, on Wednesday 24 Adar 1733 and was buried there and was eulogized by his father  and his mechuten hagaon haRav Jehonatan m’Prag. And his brother, the  martyr mvhr”r Gabriel seGal, struck do
2 CONC wn at the khx” [I think this refers to the expulsion/pogrom] in Prag by the plunderers who were doing the looting of the ?Bandorin??, and all of the streets in the Jewish quarter, on Friday, 22 Kislev 1744, and he was buried there
2 CONC , may G”d avenge his blood.  And their father gave gold in memory of each of them.
