1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ADDED BY HANAN BARADON JUNE 2011:  Elias came to South Africa after the death of his wife in Lithuania. He had been widowed a long time.He brought up his four girls and one son. He had a general store in Ferreira (
2 CONC Johannesburg). When his grandchildren, Rose and Harold, were thrown out by their stepmother after the untimely death of his daughter Helena, he helped them as much as he could and Harold was able to live with him for a while sleep
2 CONC ing under the counter in the shop.
2 CONT
2 CONT South Africa, Transvaal, Probate Records from the Master of the Supreme Court, Name:	Elias Rabinowitz Event Type:	Probate Event Date:	1925 Event Place:	Transvaal, South Africa Age:	79 Relationship to Deceased:	Deceased Birth Year 
2 CONC (Estimated):	1846 Birthplace:	Salant Death Date:	12 Jul 1925 Death Place:	Johannesburg
