2 CONT "Other sources confirm the association of the Besht with members of certain distinguished families, including David Heilperin ben Yisrael (d. 1765), a prosperous member of a very illustrious family, who from 1737 on was the rabbi 
2 CONC of the important community of Ostrog. Later, it is said, he left office and went to live in Zaslaw as a private citizen. Heilperin's published testament included bequests of quite substantial sums to many of the Besht's associates
2 CONC ." (See book for details).
