2 CONC pedia.org/wiki/Ska%C5%82a]), who composed the book of 'Zera Yitzhak' on the Mishnah (Frankfurt, 1732)" (Introduction. p. 3).  Passed away on the 27th day of Elul, 5486 [=1726] (ibid, n. 7).
