2 CONC ona, also he was a descendant of the Shlah which would make sense being the son-in-law who was a direct descendant , also such a type of mistake in such Yichus letters are common (being called the same name etc...). The merge betw
2 CONC een his father Avraham and Avraham of Pozan is based on assumption, according to the dates r Yona cannot be a child of some of the Shlas children but there are a few that he can be, and since this Avraham is known it was merged wi
2 CONC th him. דע את אבותיך ד"ר ברינה פרידר.
