1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Possible error:
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a disagreement as to the parents of Yitzchok of Zolkiew, father of Nachman Horodenker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Some sources [Loeb family tree; Tamara Rubinstein on geni.com] state that his father was Feivel Bumsla of Prague, while his mother was Feigale Katz, daughter of Chaim HaKohen Katz and Chaya Luria [Tamara Rubinstein on geni.com].
2 CONT
2 CONT Other sources [Putik & Polakovic. Judah Loew ben Bezalel, Called Maharal - a study ...; Rabbi Nachman descent tree] state that his father was Samuel Zanwil of Zolkiew, while his mother was Perel Katz of Zolkiew [Neil Rosenstein; L
2 CONC oeb family tree; Putik; Rabbi Nachman descent tree].
2 CONT
2 CONT For this tree, we have followed the latter placement.
