1 OCCU rabbin de la principauté de Brandenburg-Ansbach
1 TITL R'
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ou Josué Héchel Aaron Levouf ou Yehoshua Heshel Lvov...
2 CONT
2 CONT rabbin assesseur à Metz, puis rabbin principal à Trêves (1723-1742), à Schwabach (1743-1771), Landesrabbiner d'Ansbach
2 CONT
2 CONT It is more likely that he was born in Trier rather than in Westhoffen. His father died in 1812 and served in Westhoffen just under 20 years, so he probably arrived in 1693 Joshua was born 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT revue 81 du CGJ p. 4
2 CONT
2 CONT décès le 28 février 1771 selon RH?
2 CONT The correct date of death is Sunday, 13th January 1771, (27th Tevet 5531)
2 CONT This is mentioned clearly in the Memorbuch of Treuchtlingen no. 33 and the Memorbuch of Schwabach no. 13.
2 CONT http://digital.bib-bvb.de/view/bvb_mets/viewer.0.6.5.jsp?folder_id=0&dvs=1653463457011~59&pid=17035811&locale=en&usePid1=true&usePid2=true
2 CONT See Die Memorbücher der jüdischen Gemeinden in Bayern, p. 207 and p. 220.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1913--1996- The Eger Family Association- pg. 39
2 CONT
2 CONT 1913--1990- The Eger Family Association-אילן יח-
