1 NOTE {geni:about_me} This figure is one of two persons conjectured to be the Rappaport who married into the Schach HaCohen line based on the facts that 1) her husband Yitzach Avraham (Otser HaRabanim # 10727: https://www.geni.com/peopl
2 CONC e/%D7%A8%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%97%D7%A7-%D7%90%D7%91%D7%A8%D7%94%D7%9D-%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%9F-%D7%9B-%D7%A5-%D7%90%D7%91-%D7%93-%D7%A4%D7%99%D7%A0%D7%98%D7%A9%D7%95%D7%91-%D7%9E%D7%97-%D7%A1-%D7%A9
2 CONC %D7%95-%D7%AA-%D7%9B%D7%AA%D7%A8-%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%95%D7%A0%D7%94/6000000000961693663) is at one point ABD in Stobnits, 2) her proposed father, Avraham Rofe Rappaport HaCohen (https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Avraham-Hacohen-Rafa/6
2 CONC 000000003636327056) was Rav at Schidlow and married the daughter of the Stobnits rabbi, whose father Yitzach was Rav at Schidlow, 3) a HaCohen-bat HaCohen marriage would have been highly desirable to the families. Further, this is
2 CONC  the first generation given the Rappaport surname in any source (Unbroken Chain, see sources) and their son Zev David Rappaport HaCohen is the first of a multi generational HaCohen Rappaport rabbinical dynasty in Pinczow that last
2 CONC ed 175 years. Further evidence is sought. (05 SEP 2025).
2 CONT
2 CONT The other person who is conjectured to be the Rappaport who married into the Shach HaCohen line is: https://www.geni.com/people/Sara-Szprynca-Rappaport/6000000003514373398 (12 OCT 2025)
2 CONT
2 CONT Pinkhkes Poyln calls https://www.geni.com/people/R-Yitzchok-Katz-AB-D-Pintchuv/6000000211576548856 a Rapaport. but refers to his brother https://www.geni.com/people/%D7%A8%D7%91%D7%99-%D7%99%D7%A6%D7%97%D7%A7-%D7%90%D7%91%D7%A8%D7
2 CONC %94%D7%9D-%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%9F-%D7%9B-%D7%A5-%D7%90%D7%91-%D7%93-%D7%A4%D7%99%D7%A0%D7%98%D7%A9%D7%95%D7%91-%D7%9E%D7%97-%D7%A1-%D7%A9%D7%95-%D7%AA-%D7%9B%D7%AA%D7%A8-%D7%9B%D7%94%D7%95%D7%A0%D7%94/600
2 CONC 0000000961693663 as merely a Katz HaCohen and the father of both, https://www.geni.com/people/Rabbi-Moshe-Rappaport/6000000000961693681, is not given the name Rapaport in any source that I know about. 12 OCT 2025
2 CONT
2 CONT As of this writing it seems that the correct hypothesis is that the father of https://www.geni.com/people/Sara-Szprynca-Rappaport/6000000003514373398 is from the Rapaport tree. 12 OCT 2025
