2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From M. Dworzhetsky, the History of Jewish Wladimir, in Pinkas Ludmir; sefer zikaron le-kehilat Ludmir:
2 CONT
2 CONT Rabbi Ephraim Zalman was Head of the Rabbinic Court in Berestechko and later Head of the Rabbinic Court in Dubno. He was the son-in-law of Rabbi Israel (Harif), Head of the Rabbinic Court in Zaslawye and Ostroh.
