1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Gabriel Markbreit aka Gabriel Markbreiter (Katzenellenbogen)
2 CONT
2 CONT A.B.D. Mecklenberg and Nikolsburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Named after his maternal grandfather Rabbi Gabriel Eskeles.  Surnamed Markbreit where his father was a Rabbi and he was most likely born. He married Keila Bing.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Source=
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (1990) Volume 1, Chapter 11, page 96,
2 CONT G 9.7
