1 CONT According to the Jewish Encyclopedia (Vol. 11, p.523, #23), he was the son of Samson Spira, rabbi at Grodno, and died in 1577.  Wrote under the title "Imrei Shefer" - commentaries on Rashi and Eliah Mizrachi - published by his son
