1 CONC 91. He was first A.B.D The Community at the time was under Danish Rule, the salary he was to  receive being five hundred kroner from the Altona members, two hundred  from the Hamburg members and a smaller amount from the Wandsbeck
1 CONC  members  over a three-year period. This was
