1 CONC on of R. Mordecai Gershom HaKohen of Cracow. In 1664 he wrote his approbation to Amudeha Shivah by Bezalel son of Solomon Darshan of Slutzk and Korbin, published Lublin 1666, where he signed himself Moses Kahane.
