0 @N6000000003327798288@ NOTE
1 CONT G4.5. R. Isaac Harif, A.B.D. of Constantin and Ludmir, is mentioned in the Responsa of R. Joel Sirkes (BaCh). Although he is not mentioned in the history of the Jews of Posen by Pereles,  he was apparently Rabbi there.  He married
1 CONC  the daughter of Jacob Deltsch of Ludmir.
